			y: 2.0d,
			optional: true,
			title: "The Stadium",
			description: ["Raise the Stadium.", "", "It needs a Town, the Master Architect, and the Pokémon Professor (or 25 pastured Pokémon of 10 types).", "", "To raise it: on the hall's Wonders page, click its card once every line is ticked, then build it as in \"Your first Wonder\". A village raises one Wonder at a time.", "", "While it stands, visiting trainers come for Stadium Days every second afternoon, and the Festival Cup is held there.", "", "Click the checkmark above once your village has raised the Stadium."],
